# size 20x5
# A scrolling region that does NOT start at the top of the screen. The line leaving the region has
# not left the screen - rows above the region are still showing - so nothing goes to the scrollback.
#
# The other half of scrollregion, and written because the oracle contradicted the assumption behind
# that case rather than because the rule was known in advance.
\e[H\e[2Jtop-a\r\ntop-b\r\nmid-c\r\nmid-d\r\nmid-e
\e[3;5r\e[5;1Hpush-1\r\npush-2\r\n
\e[r
